      "title": "Greif Reopens Esteio-RS Facility in 2026: Rebuilt, More Modern, and Ready for the Future",
      "summary": "The floods that struck Rio Grande do Sul in April and May of 2024 left lasting impacts across the state. More than 470 municipalities were affected,",
      "published_at": "2026-05-12T15:10:50+00:00",
      "fetched_at": "2026-07-28T22:13:25.865061+00:00",
      "article_path": "articles/v1/0d/greif-inc-class-a-common-stock/2026/05/33/3310a7592e30d888b0667d026354822a10ef13f217cd3eb6b82878a6c4acc1f5/article.md",
      "record_path": "articles/v1/0d/greif-inc-class-a-common-stock/2026/05/33/3310a7592e30d888b0667d026354822a10ef13f217cd3eb6b82878a6c4acc1f5/record.json"
